<%# One episode card of a product page -- the customer page and the admin preview render the same card so the preview
    shows what a customer sees (handoff 0066). Only the link target differs, and the admin preview adds the episode's
    number and status before the title and says "편집하기 →" instead of "보기 →", because its link opens the admin
    edit page (handoff 0084 R2: the customer CTA was "학습 시작 →"). The customer card shows no episode number at
    all -- position is an ordering key (it can be 0), not something a visitor needs to read; the URL still uses
    display_id. The customer CTA is fixed text: there is no per-episode progress to vary it by.

    Handoff 0067 -- (admin: number + status,) title and CTA sit on one row (the number and CTA never shrink or wrap;
    only the title does, via truncate + a title tooltip, same as before). Below `sm` the CTA alone drops to its own
    line (`w-full` forces the wrap; `sm:w-auto` plus `sm:ml-auto` puts it back at the right end of the row). The
    number span is omitted entirely on the customer card rather than left empty, so the row's gap doesn't push the
    title right. No per-episode state (e.g. a lock icon) exists on this card today.

    Handoff 0070 -- an optional one-line teaser (episode.summary) as a second line, plain text, truncated to one
    line with a title tooltip for the full text when it's cut off (same convention as the title above); skipped
    entirely when blank.

    Handoff 0073 -- data-turbo-prefetch="false": Turbo would otherwise fetch the episode on hover and reuse that
    response on click, so the click itself never reaches the server and the view can't be counted (prefetches are
    deliberately not counted). Every link to a customer episode page carries this. %>
<% admin = local_assigns.fetch(:admin, false) %>
<% title = episode.customer_title.presence || "(제목 없음)" %>
<% dark = local_assigns.fetch(:dark, false) %>
<%= link_to path, data: { turbo_prefetch: false }, class: series_theme(:card, dark) do %>
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1">
    <% if admin %><span class="shrink-0 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400"><%= episode.display_id %> · <%= episode.status %></span><% end %>
    <%# Handoff 0092 R2 -- the admin preview marks an 열린 편 (the customer card's own label comes in R3). %>
    <% if admin && episode.open_preview_on? %><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700">로그인 없이 보기</span><% end %>
    <span class="<%= series_theme(:card_title, dark) %>" title="<%= title %>"><%= title %></span>
    <span class="<%= series_theme(:card_cta, dark) %>"><%= admin ? "편집하기 →" : "보기 →" %></span>
  </div>
  <% if episode.summary.present? %>
    <p class="<%= series_theme(:card_summary, dark) %>" title="<%= episode.summary %>"><%= episode.summary %></p>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
